### 🔥 Key Capabilities

> 🎯 **Smart Intent Classification**
> Routes incoming user queries dynamically across 7 custom branches via a dedicated LLM Question Classifier.

> 🌐 **Live Web Recipe Scraping**
> Accepts raw cooking blog links, strips out irrelevant clutter, and formats the output into step-by-step cooking guides.

> 🥑 **Ingredient Substitutions**
> Generates practical alternatives on the fly when users are missing essential pantry items.

> 📊 **Nutritional Breakdown**
> Offers immediate estimates for calories, macronutrients, and dietary guidelines.

> 🛡️ **Domain Guardrails**
> Keeps conversations focused on food and cooking by politely filtering out off-topic requests.

