### 🛠️ Architecture & Workflow Pipeline

```text
[START] ➔ [QUESTION CLASSIFIER] ──┬─ (Class 1) ➔ [GREETING] ─────────────┬➔ [ANSWER]
                                  ├─ (Class 2) ➔ [RECIPE] ───────────────┤
                                  ├─ (Class 3) ➔ [INGREDIENTS LLM] ──────┤
                                  ├─ (Class 4) ➔ [SUBSTITUTION LLM] ─────┤
                                  ├─ (Class 5) ➔ [NUTRITION LLM] ────────┤
                                  ├─ (Class 6) ➔ [UNRELATED LLM] ────────┤
                                  └─ (Class 7) ➔ [WEB SCRAPER] ➔ [LLM] ──┘

```

#### Detailed Node Matrix

| Branch ID | Node Name | Role & Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `01` | **Greeting** | Welcomes users and introduces assistant capabilities. |
| `02` | **Recipe** | Generates tailored recipes with cooking instructions and times. |
| `03` | **Ingredients LLM** | Suggests dishes based on available ingredients. |
| `04` | **Substitution LLM** | Offers alternative options for missing ingredients. |
| `05` | **Nutrition LLM** | Provides macro and calorie calculations. |
| `06` | **Unrelated LLM** | Acts as a guardrail, redirecting non-culinary queries. |
| `07` | **Web Scraper & LLM** | Extracts content from live URL links and structures the output. |

